{"title":"Gift of Frozen Flames","slug":"Gift_of_Frozen_Flames","hero":null,"pageid":4745,"revid":20950,"timestamp":"2025-12-28T17:23:52Z","lastEditor":"Darkfmb29","categories":[],"infobox":{"type":"Objects","fields":[{"label":"Island","value":"Finlay"},{"label":"Shop","value":"Santa`s Workshop"},{"label":"Price","value":"❄️50.000"}]},"sections":[{"id":"description","text":"Description"}],"body":"<blockquote><p><i>\"The sound of cold and violent flames radiates through this gift...\"</i></p></blockquote><figure typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\"> \t<span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: Gift of Frozen Flames\">Gift of Frozen Flames</span> \t \t<figcaption> \t\t \t\t\t<span data-unresolved=\"1\"><svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg></span> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t\t\t<p>Gift of Frozen Flames</p> \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure>\n<h2 id=\"description\">Description</h2>\n<p><b>Gift of Frozen Flames</b> is an exclusive gift added in the <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/2025_Christmas_Event/\">2025 Christmas Event</a>. It's a short, blue gift with stars and a white bow. Something interesting is that it's clearly a cube-shaped model that's been scaled to be wider, seen in the warped star texture.\n</p>\n<figure typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\"> \t<span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: Gift of Frozen Flames in Santas workshop for ❄️50\">Gift of Frozen Flames in Santas workshop for ❄️50</span> \t \t<figcaption> \t\t \t\t\t<span data-unresolved=\"1\"><svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg></span> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t\t\t<p><b>Gift of Frozen Flames in Santas workshop for ❄️50.000</b></p> \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure>\n<p>can be obtained through the <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Christmas_Daily_Advent_Calendar/\">Christmas Daily Advent Calendar</a>, or buyed in <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Santa's_Workshop/\">Santa's Workshop</a> for ❄️50.000.\n</p><p>When opening you get an <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Icethrower/\">Icethrower</a>.\n</p>"}
